              "body": "Neurology follow-up, visit 2/11/2026.\n\nInterval: one breakthrough generalized tonic-clonic seizure on 1/6/2026 requiring ICU admission for postictal hypoventilation; valproate level 71 at that time, adherence reported as good. Nothing since. Diary otherwise blank since May 2025. Tolerating medication without tremor or GI effects.\n\nMedications: valproic acid 500 mg twice daily. Allergies: NKDA.\n\nExam: alert and oriented, cranial nerves intact, strength and reflexes normal and symmetric, gait normal, no tremor.\n\nAssessment: epilepsy, one breakthrough seizure in the past 9 months on valproic acid.\n\nPlan: continue valproic acid 500 mg twice daily. Seizure precautions; no driving until 7/6/2026. Return in 6 months or sooner with any event."
